    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your body transforms into a primitive form, similar to that of an orc or gorilla. Your arms lengthen and grow in strength, your shoulders widen and your body swells with muscle. This makes you very strong, but unfortunately your mind becomes more primitive too and your body somewhat unbalanced . You gain +10 Strength and Toughness, and -10 Agility and Intelligence. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.zImcTgEl2XNnbu5W]{Hardy} Talent.</p>"
